            <ArticleTitle>Fatality due to fentanyl-cocaine intoxication resulting in a fall.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>271-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This is the first report of fatal intoxication by fentanyl and cocaine outside the USA. The case involved a fall caused by toxic psychosis. The circumstantial, clinical, anatomical, histopathological and toxicological frame-work is interpreted.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
